# draco-tree-sitter.skill - Phase 3: Tree-sitter Codebase Skeleton Extraction

## Purpose
Phase 3 skill for Tree-sitter codebase skeleton extraction across 30+ programming languages. Achieves 70% codebase token reduction while preserving full functional equivalence.

